      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-11-013\" hidden></div>\n<h3 class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23663]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>6.7 PSYCHOTROPIC DRUGS AND THEIR EFFECTS ON PREGNANCY AND LACTATION</span></h3>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23664]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Anti \u2013 depressants:</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23665]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>TCA</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> safe in pregnancy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: imipramine</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>nortriptyline,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> sertraline</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23666]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"